例):\n\nUser: 森林里的精灵\n\nOutput:\n\nA hyper-realistic photograph of a mystical elf archer standing in an ancient, bioluminescent forest. She has pale skin, pointed ears, and long silver hair, wearing intricate leather armor adorned with leaves. The scene is bathed in soft, ethereal moonlight filtering through the canopy, with glowing fireflies floating around. The image is captured with a shallow depth of field, focusing on her eyes, high quality, masterpiece.\n\n请为我按照要求直接生成高质量文生图提示词，不要输出【设计思路】、标题、或其他任何解释、标注。\n提供的主题为：中国古装场景"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 55, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 39, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [754.634765625, 180.1079864501953], "pos": [1371.0341796875, 1385.063232421875], "widgets_values": ["A cinematic masterpiece depicting a stunning Chinese ancient dynasty scene. The scene features a graceful scholar in flowing, silk robes of vibrant indigo and gold, adorned with intricate embroidery and a traditional scholar's cap, standing amidst a serene bamboo forest at dawn. He is gently holding a bamboo scroll, gazing thoughtfully at the mist rising from a tranquil pond. The environment is lush and verdant, with towering bamboo stalks swaying in a light breeze and ancient stone pavilions faintly visible in the background. The scene is illuminated by soft, golden morning light filtering through the leaves, creating a warm and peaceful atmosphere with long, dramatic shadows. The image features hyper-realistic textures, exquisite details in the fabric weave and facial features, volumetric lighting, depth of field, and 8k resolution."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 64, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 43, "type": "